2. between the Company & Grasim Industries Limited;
3. between Novelis Corporation & Logan Aluminum Inc.;
4. between Novelis Korea Limited and Ulsan Aluminum Limited;
5. between Novelis Deutschland GmbH and Aluminium Norf GmbH.
The Voting Results ('Annexure A') and the Scrutinizer's Report ('Annexure B') is enclosed. The same are being
made available on the website of the Company www.hindalco.com and on the website of National Securities
Depository Limited (NSDL) www.evoting.nsdl.com.

